<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Welcome to Flagship Towing</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Nunito:wght@400;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        body {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            font-family: 'Nunito', sans-serif;
            background-color: #f4f4f7;
            font-size: 15px;
            line-height: 1.5;
            color: #333;
        }
        .email-wrap {
            max-width: 560px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 24px 16px;
        }
        .card {
            background: #fff;
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 28px 24px;
        }
        .brand {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        .brand img {
            max-height: 44px;
            width: auto;
        }
        .divider {
            height: 3px;
            background: #0118FF;
            margin: 0 0 20px 0;
            border-radius: 2px;
        }
        .greeting {
            font-size: 16px;
            color: #333;
            margin: 0 0 16px 0;
        }
        .message {
            margin: 0 0 20px 0;
            color: #444;
        }
        .message strong {
            color: #0118FF;
        }
        .cta-wrap {
            margin: 24px 0;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .cta {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 12px 24px;
            background: #0118FF;
            color: #ffffff !important;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 15px;
            border-radius: 6px;
        }
        .small {
            font-size: 13px;
            color: #666;
            margin: 16px 0 0 0;
        }
        .sign-off {
            margin-top: 24px;
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #555;
        }
        .footer {
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #999;
            padding: 20px 0 0;
        }
        .info-table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            margin: 16px 0 8px 0;
        }
        .info-table td {
            padding: 4px 0;
            font-size: 14px;
        }
        .info-table td:first-child {
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #555;
            width: 120px;
        }
        .store-buttons {
            text-align: center;
            margin: 20px 0 8px 0;
        }
        .store-buttons img {
            height: 40px;
            margin: 0 8px;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <div class="email-wrap">
        <div class="card">
            <div class="brand">
                <img src="https://static.spacecrafted.com/f3a81e09e3c348aaa519f655fc613f4f/i/c677f51b921b42cc8caee4de7e4cb426/1/5feFb8zhrk/FTLogoLongNew.png?dpr=2" alt="Flagship Towing">
            </div>
            <div class="divider"></div>

            <p class="greeting">Hi <%= name %>,</p>

            <p class="message">
                Welcome to <strong>Flagship Towing</strong>! Your account has been successfully created.
            </p>

            <p class="message">
                Below are your login credentials:
            </p>

            <table class="info-table">
                <tr>
                    <td>Email:</td>
                    <td><%= email %></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>Password:</td>
                    <td><%= password %></td>
                </tr>
            </table>

            <div class="store-buttons">
                <a href="https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.genesysglobal.flagship" target="_blank">
                    <img src="https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/78/Google_Play_Store_badge_EN.svg"
                        alt="Google Play">
                </a>

                <a href="https://apps.apple.com/us/app/flagship-towing/id6747052086" target="_blank">
                    <img src="https://developer.apple.com/assets/elements/badges/download-on-the-app-store.svg"
                        alt="App Store">
                </a>
            </div>

            <p class="small">
                If you haven't already done so, please download the Flagship Towing mobile app using the links above
                and create your profile.
            </p>

            <p class="small">
                You can download the Flagship Towing mobile app using the links above and log in using your
                credentials.
            </p>

            <p class="sign-off">
                If you need any support, feel free to contact us.<br>
                <strong>Flagship Towing Team</strong>
            </p>

            <div class="footer">
                © <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> Flagship Towing. All rights reserved.
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>

</html>